  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>&#916;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>iK</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So, percentage association <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>%</mo></math>.</p>"
